{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-032",
    "title": "失去名字的人"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_181",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "叶观澜看向陆照临：“你要作证，就必须进入门内。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "天门第一声鸣响后，回川城的雪停了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5657,
          "end": 5657
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "停下的不是雪，而是所有人的时间。街边飘落的雪花悬在半空，火盆里的灰烬凝成灰白色的线，连陆照临眼角滑下的泪也停在半途。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5659,
          "end": 5659
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "只有天门仍在开启。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5661,
          "end": 5661
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "它没有门扇，也没有门框，天空裂缝向两侧缓慢拉开，露出一片没有星辰的黑暗。黑暗中漂浮着无数灯火，每一盏灯下都站着一个模糊的人影。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5663,
          "end": 5663
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它在召回被删去的人。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5665,
          "end": 5665
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“召回之后呢？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5667,
          "end": 5667
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“回到记忆里，或者回到人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5669,
          "end": 5669
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有什么区别？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5671,
          "end": 5671
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆里的人不会再离开，人间的人不会再保持原样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5673,
          "end": 5673
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向街道。时间恢复流动，居民同时发出惊呼。有人认出了失踪多年的亲人，有人看见陌生人站在自家门口，彼此的记忆重叠成一片混乱。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5675,
          "end": 5675
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜冲上钟楼：“城外的灵气在倒灌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5677,
          "end": 5677
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处山脉亮起青光，河流开始逆向。回川城的房屋从地基处裂开，裂缝中长出半透明的树根，树根缠住门窗，把屋内的人拖向城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5679,
          "end": 5679
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先救人。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5681,
          "end": 5681
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离已经冲下街道。她的债契黑纹虽然被铜针截断，颈侧仍留着一圈深色印记。她用铜针挑断树根，将被困的孩子交给家人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5683,
          "end": 5683
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "可那名父亲看见孩子后，忽然哭喊：“这不是我的女儿！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5685,
          "end": 5685
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子抬头：“爹，我记得你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5687,
          "end": 5687
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不记得你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5689,
          "end": 5689
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一掌击在父亲胸口，逼他后退：“记忆不一致，不代表人是假的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5691,
          "end": 5691
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "父亲仍在摇头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5693,
          "end": 5693
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临跑到街心，将无名小灯放在地面。小灯没有火，却释放出一圈稳定的白光。白光经过的人，记忆冲突暂时减弱。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5695,
          "end": 5695
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“范围太小。”叶观澜从钟楼跃下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5697,
          "end": 5697
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯带到城门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5699,
          "end": 5699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城门正在塌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5701,
          "end": 5701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就先撑住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5703,
          "end": 5703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜拔刀斩向裂缝。刀光化作黑色弧线，暂时封住城墙上的缺口。灵气倒灌却越来越强，黑色弧线表面迅速结霜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5705,
          "end": 5705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻站在钟楼下，敲响无相铜镜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5707,
          "end": 5707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离站在两条重叠的街道之间。她看见一个年轻男人从旧城门走来，正是她叔父的模样。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5733,
          "end": 5733
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯给我。”男人说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5735,
          "end": 5735
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你不是他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5737,
          "end": 5737
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我是他被留下的部分。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5739,
          "end": 5739
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还记得自己的名字吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5741,
          "end": 5741
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男人沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5743,
          "end": 5743
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离将铜针抵在他胸口：“说出来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5745,
          "end": 5745
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾……长……”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5747,
          "end": 5747
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最后一个字没有出现。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5749,
          "end": 5749
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "债契黑纹从顾长离颈侧重新生长，向那道影子缠去。影子没有躲，任由黑纹穿过身体。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5751,
          "end": 5751
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你的名字缺一笔。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5753,
          "end": 5753
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以我回来找你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5755,
          "end": 5755
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她抬起铜针，却迟迟没有刺下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5757,
          "end": 5757
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无名小灯递给她：“先让他停下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5759,
          "end": 5759
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯会吸走他的影子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5761,
          "end": 5761
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不吸，他会被天门带走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5763,
          "end": 5763
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离接过小灯。白光照在年轻男人身上，他的脸开始变得清晰，最后却定格成一张没有五官的面孔。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5765,
          "end": 5765
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我记得你。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5767,
          "end": 5767
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "无脸影子向她伸出手：“那就替我记住。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5769,
          "end": 5769
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白光骤然扩大，影子化作一枚铜环，落入顾长离掌心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5771,
          "end": 5771
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的债契黑纹随即向心口收缩，像被重新锁住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5773,
          "end": 5773
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你把他的名字带回来了。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5775,
          "end": 5775
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“只带回了铜环。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5777,
          "end": 5777
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字还在门里。”慧闻提醒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5779,
          "end": 5779
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "远处天门黑暗中，第三盏灯缓缓升高。灯火照出一道熟悉的身影：陆沉舟站在门槛另一侧，手里提着空灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5781,
          "end": 5781
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临。”他说，“不要上来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5783,
          "end": 5783
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临向前一步：“我要把你带回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5785,
          "end": 5785
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你带不回完整的我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5787,
          "end": 5787
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就是门楔。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5898,
          "end": 5898
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他站在钟楼另一侧，手里捧着无相铜镜。镜面照出青铜碎片，却照不出上面的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5900,
          "end": 5900
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“名字已经被门取走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5902,
          "end": 5902
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“怎么拿回来？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5904,
          "end": 5904
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让门承认他们曾经属于人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5906,
          "end": 5906
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“怎么承认？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5908,
          "end": 5908
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“需要一个仍记得的人作证。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5910,
          "end": 5910
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有目光转向陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5912,
          "end": 5912
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只记得我父亲。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5914,
          "end": 5914
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“足够。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5916,
          "end": 5916
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城外传来号角。玄霄宗修士开始在城墙外布阵，白玉令牌连成一片，形成一道封锁光幕。归墟盟的人则从东门潜入，试图靠近天门下方的青铜碎片。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5918,
          "end": 5918
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向陆照临：“你要作证，就必须进入门内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5920,
          "end": 5920
        }
      }
    ],
